    "description": {
      "content": "The Tines REST API provides programmatic access to all platform resources including stories (workflows), actions, credentials, teams, folders, cases, records, dashboards, audit logs, SCIM provisioning, AI usage tracking, reporting, tags, and the workbench. The API uses API key authentication via X-User-Token header or Bearer token and is accessed via each tenant's custom subdomain.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Tines API Documentation",
